  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (188-EX-01c, 188-PROP-01D, Unnumbered location plan, Support Statement. Received: 10/11/2016) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - The exhaust flue shall be provided in accordance with the approved plans (188-EX-01c, 188-PROP-01D, Unnumbered location plan, Support Statement. Received: 10/11/2016), before the use is brought into operation, and when at maximum operation shall not result in noise that is more than 10dB(A) below background noise levels for the site. The exhaust flue shall include the following details:\r\n(a) A three-stage filtration system, including grease filters, pre-carbon filters and carbon filters, to be located inside the site.\r\n(b) The point of discharge shall be a minimum of one meter above eaves level or one metre above openable windows of nearby properties.\r\n(c)  The ducting shall be circular.\r\n(d) The fan shall be isolated from the inlet and discharge ducts using flexible couplings.\r\n(e)   The fan shall be mounted using anti-vibration mounts.\r\n(f) The duct shall be isolated from the structure of the building using anti-vibration mouldings and suitable packing material where it passes through solid structures."
  ],
